262
00:16:02,500 --> 00:16:05,265
a bit unsettled this
evening in the Upper Yard.

263
00:16:07,560 --> 00:16:09,380
No one here gets out alive.

264
00:16:11,220 --> 00:16:14,257
The ones who escaped
sacrifice are off my list.

265
00:16:14,340 --> 00:16:18,634
It seems there are others roaming
around who are more worthy of my anger!

266
00:16:43,220 --> 00:16:44,960
All of you, listen up!

267
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:48,301
Today we catch up her yard
at her most vulnerable.

268
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:50,760
This is the opportunity of a lifetime.

269
00:16:51,460 --> 00:16:55,417
We move full speed ahead and don't
stop until we reach God's shrine.

270
00:16:55,500 --> 00:16:57,320
And do not fear Anaru.

271
00:16:57,700 --> 00:17:00,759
The great warrior Kalgar
is our one and only savior.

272
00:17:01,060 --> 00:17:02,472
Only to him are we true.

273
00:17:06,040 --> 00:17:06,870
Abraham?

274
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:08,580
Ready. Kamakiri!

275
00:17:09,800 --> 00:17:10,630
Jinbe!

276
00:17:11,500 --> 00:17:12,330
Lucky!

277
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:13,550
Right!

278
00:17:13,820 --> 00:17:14,650
Be careful!

279
00:17:14,920 --> 00:17:16,120
We split up here!

280
00:17:20,740 --> 00:17:24,900
We vow to the great warrior Kaldura
to light the fire of Shandora!

281
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:34,020
So the Shandians have come for a fight!

282
00:17:41,420 --> 00:17:43,017
Speaks for itself pretty well.

283
00:17:43,100 --> 00:17:43,930
Look at it.

284
00:17:44,013 --> 00:17:44,938
It's almost unreal.

285
00:17:46,740 --> 00:17:48,340
But it's no fairy tale.

286
00:17:49,140 --> 00:17:50,787
That doesn't make any sense.

287
00:17:50,900 --> 00:17:51,977
Why would this be here?

288
00:17:52,060 --> 00:17:53,417
It looks exactly the same.

289
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:54,500
It's like a copy.

290
00:17:54,740 --> 00:17:55,640
But it's not.

291
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:57,259
How do you figure?

292
00:17:57,620 --> 00:18:00,760
This is the other half of
what we saw before. Go on.

293
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:03,297
It's bugged me for a while.

294
00:18:03,380 --> 00:18:06,909
Why is it that we walk on soil
here instead of Island Cloud?

295
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:08,250
This dirt,

296
00:18:08,460 --> 00:18:10,017
there's nothing in the makeup of the White

297
00:18:10,100 --> 00:18:12,737
White Sea that would
allow for its existence.

298
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:16,408
So, the ground that we're walking
on shouldn't exist up here.

299
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:19,720
Upper Yard was originally on the ground.

300
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:24,380
I knew that house was off
when I saw it. Thing is,

301
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:29,504
it's a Twister house, and there was no
staircase leading up to the second story.

302
00:18:30,040 --> 00:18:33,628
And what would make you build
a house on the edge of a cliff?

303
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:37,220
But then again, it wasn't a cliff at all.

304
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:44,437
Look closer, it's really unattractive.

305
00:18:44,520 --> 00:18:48,344
the guys gotta have some serious
guts to build a house that ugly!

306
00:18:57,000 --> 00:19:00,059
This is the half of the
island that was ripped away?

307
00:19:03,460 --> 00:19:06,060
This island used to be part of Jaya.

308
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:10,965
So what that means is a
few hundred years back?

309
00:19:11,120 --> 00:19:15,097
The island below us split in half,
and one side of it rose into the sky.

310
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:16,010
No!

311
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:20,504
Either of you know how
that could have happened?

312
00:19:22,260 --> 00:19:25,260
There were south birds,
a whole flock of them.

313
00:19:26,360 --> 00:19:27,280
They're huge.

314
00:19:27,620 --> 00:19:29,520
I didn't know they got so big.

315
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:52,960
Saru, would you wake up already? Huh?

316
00:19:53,280 --> 00:19:54,380
You're a dead man.

317
00:19:56,620 --> 00:19:57,660
That's the best!

318
00:19:58,740 --> 00:20:00,760
This is no time for goofing off!

319
00:20:06,500 --> 00:20:09,577
The city of gold that
Nolan discovered on the

320
00:20:09,660 --> 00:20:12,601
ground didn't sink into
the ocean like he guessed.

321
00:20:16,180 --> 00:20:21,820
This part of Jaya, it's been
floating in the sky for 400 years!
